    "title": "\"It's negligence at this point\" - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Hunt Murty ,\n8 hours ago Two substantially identical bills filed in the Florida House and Senate propose a definitive end to the fragmented 911 system that investigators identified as a critical failure during the 2018 Parkland shooting. By mandating unified dispatch centers, the state legislators hope to override decades of local bureaucratic turf wars to prioritize speed and interoperability. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
